    "updated_at": "2016-06-03T07:52:50Z",
    "body": "I would object to merging these two concepts because the construction stack is a quirk that's only required for upgrading an element.  In fact, I was advocating to add a new argument to the operator `[Construct]` that specifies the exotic object so that this quirk doesn't even exist in the upgrading case.\n",
