    "created_at": "2016-06-03T23:31:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-03T23:32:16Z",
    "body": "Note that the situation construction stack can't solve is constructing another instance of itself, not calling `super()` twice:\n\n``` js\nMyElement extends HTMLElement {\n    constructor(stop) {\n        if (!stop)\n            new MyElement(true);\n        super();\n    }\n}\n```\n",
